OpenNolan
=========

OpenNolan is an AGPL-3.0 fork of OpenMontage.

This product includes software developed by the OpenMontage project and its
contributors. The original work and the substantial majority of this codebase
were created by calesthio. OpenNolan preserves that authorship and adds
further contributions on top of it.

